    "3d759d810081f224683be795d349471d46a4a049fe7e41afa99feab16e965658": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "0ac414fc065829e70728cded38d0eac49c6e14ee054e5e2433e7b6ea80163fe5",
      "contextFingerprint": "f69f72e4eddc85dd09a450b0a12bba96a0faff4ad3ccd208bcdb62132215ad69",
      "sourceText": "- RAII = 资源获取即初始化，是 C++ 最核心的资源管理惯用法。\n- 构造时获取资源，析构时释放资源，离开作用域保证释放。\n- `std::unique_ptr`、`std::lock_guard`、`std::fstream` 都是 RAII。\n- 多个 `return`、异常、复杂分支下，RAII 的价值最明显。\n- 永远不要在析构函数中抛异常。\n- 理解了 RAII，就为理解智能指针和并发编程打好了基础。",
      "translatedText": "- RAII = Resource Acquisition Is Initialization, and is the most core resource management idiom in C++\\.\n- Acquire the resource during construction, release the resource during destruction, and ensure release when leaving the scope\\.\n- `std::unique_ptr`and`std::lock_guard`and`std::fstream` are all RAII\\.\n- Multiple `return`and under exceptions and complex branches, the value of RAII is most obvious\\.\n- Never throw exceptions from a destructor\\.\n- Once you understand RAII, you have laid a solid foundation for understanding smart pointers and concurrent programming\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 229,
        "outputTokens": 116,
        "costUsd": 0.000208
      }
    },
    "3d76bed9c9fa1c2a83c363d0494b65be02656a86bada7174e11f8e322d7885f8": {
